# Smaug, Wicked Worm: "When Smaug enters, create X tapped Treasure tokens, where X is the number of artifacts your opponents
# control." Bot2 controls two artifacts (a Mox Pearl and a Mox Sapphire) and an Island, which is no artifact; Bot1 controls its own
# Moxen, which do not count. Smaug on turn 3 makes exactly two Treasure tokens, tapped. It has flying.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Smaug, Wicked Worm
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Island
